# | Moxa ioLogik E1213 Remote Ethernet I/O — 8 DIs + 4 DOs + 4 DIOs (source type)
# | 
# | Source: ioLogik E1200 Series User Manual V16.2, August 2025 (Appendix A)
# | Protocol: Modbus/TCP (port 502); Modbus/TCP ID default = 1
# | 
# | DI channels (ch0-11, 8 dedicated DI + 4 DIO-as-DI):
# | FC02 addr 0-11: DI_status (R)
# | FC02 addr 1000-1011: DI_counterOverflowFlag (R)
# | FC01 addr 256-267: DI_counterStatus (R/W)
# | FC01 addr 272-283: DI_counterReset (R/W)
# | FC01 addr 288-299: DI_counterOverflowFlagClear (R/W)
# | FC04 addr 16-39 (2 words/ch, len 24): DI_counterValue u32 (R)
# | FC04 addr 48: DI-all_statusFromDI-00 (word, R)
# | DO/DIO channels (ch0-7, 4 dedicated DO + 4 DIO-as-DO):
@mbmap=1
@vendor=Moxa
@model=ioLogik E1213
@description=8-DI + 4-DO + 4-DIO (source) remote Ethernet I/O, Modbus/TCP. DI (12ch total) FC02: DI_status (addr 0-11), DI_counterOverflowFlag (1000-1011). DI FC01: DI_counterStatus (256), DI_counterReset (272), DI_counterOverflowFlagClear (288). DI FC04: DI_counterValue u32 (addr 16-39 len 24), DI-all_status (addr 48). DO/DIO (8ch) FC01: DO_status (0-7), DO_pulseStatus (16-23). FC03: DO_all_status (32), DO_pulseCount ch0-7 (36-43), DO_pulseOnWidth unit 1ms (52-59), DO_pulseOffWidth unit 1ms (68-75).
@source=Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST), modbus-library/moxa-iologik-e1213.toml; Source: ioLogik E1200 Series User Manual V16.2, August 2025 (Appendix A). Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation
